{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"5868b988-c0b7-48a9-86d1-9e430eae9fd1","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a clear understanding of the format and expectations. The L1 file is very comprehensive with detailed questions, keywords, and analysis. I need to produce a similarly thorough L2 file focused on Serving 调度 layer.\n\nLet me now construct the L2 question space. The preset questions are:\n- Q2.1: 单请求下，MoE, DiT, 多模态, Video Serving 如何组织调度？\n- Q2.2: 有哪些开源 Serving 框架支持这些模型？（vLLM、SGLang、TensorRT-LLM、TGI等）\n- Q2.3: Serving 层如何将请求分解为可并发执行的计算单元？\n- Q2.4: 这些 Serving 方法的实现和实验环境？\n\nI need to expand these into the method/implementation/experiment triad, and add the hardware architecture emphasis.\n\nL2 covers:\n- 单/多请求调度\n- 请求分解为计算单元\n- Serving框架支持\n- Dispatcher/SLO设计\n\nLet me map the questions to the triad:\n- Q2.1 (方法): 单请求下Serving调度策略/方法\n- Q2.2 (实现): 开源Serving框架支持\n- Q2.3 (方法+实现): 请求分解为可并发计算单元\n- Q2.4 (实验环境): 实验环境与评估\n\nI should expand these, potentially to 5-6 questions to cover the triad thoroughly. Let me think about how to structure this:\n\nFor L2 Serving 调度:\n1. Method question: How to organize scheduling for single-request MoE/DiT/multimodal/Video serving? (Q2.1)\n2. Method question: How to decompose requests into concurrently executable compute units? (Q2.3 expanded)\n3. Implementation question: What open-source serving frameworks support these models? (Q2.2)\n4. Implementation question: How do these frameworks implement dispatcher/SLO mechanisms?\n5. Experiment question: What are the experiment environments and benchmarks? (Q2.4)\n\nGiven the hardware architecture emphasis, each question should tie back to hardware implications.\n\nLet me create a well-structured 6-question space similar to L1.\n\nActually, let me re-read the instruction more carefully. The preset questions given are:\n- 2.1: Q2.1: 单请求下，MoE, DiT, 多模态, Video Serving 如何组织调度？\n- 2.2: Q2.2: 有哪些开源 Serving 框架支持这些模型？（vLLM、SGLang、TensorRT-LLM、TGI等）\n- 2.3: Q2.3: Serving 层如何将请求分解为可并发执行的计算单元？\n- 2.4: Q2.4: 这些 Serving 方法的实现和实验环境？\n\nBut the instruction also says \"可根据层的复杂度扩展为 4-6 个问题\". So I should expand to 5-6 questions for thorough coverage.\n\nLet me design 6 questions:\n\nQ2.1 - 方法: Single-request scheduling strategies (iteration-level scheduling, request decomposition, prefix caching-aware scheduling)\nQ2.2 - 实现: Open-source serving frameworks and their architecture support\nQ2.3 - 方法: Decomposing requests into concurrently executable compute units (operator-level decomposition, model-parallel decomposition)\nQ2.4 - 方法+实现: Dispatcher design for micro-operator concurrency in single-request serving\nQ2.5 - 实现+硬件: How serving frameworks' implementations map to GPU/NPU/accelerator hardware\nQ2.6 - 实验环境: Experiment environments, benchmarks, and hardware-platform comparisons\n\nActually, let me reconsider. The core triad is method/implementation/experiment. Let me structure it as:\n\nQ2.1 (方法): Scheduling organization strategies for single-request MoE/DiT/multimodal/Video\nQ2.2 (实现): Open-source serving frameworks - architecture and model support \nQ2.3 (方法): Request decomposition into concurrent compute units - methods and algorithms\nQ2.4 (方法): Dispatcher/SLO design for micro-operator concurrency - strategies and trade-offs\nQ2.5 (实现): Implementation mapping of serving schedulers to hardware platforms (GPU/NPU/accelerator)\nQ2.6 (实验环境): Experiment environments, benchmarks, key metrics, hardware platform comparisons\n\nThis gives us 3 method questions, 2 implementation questions, and 1 experiment question (with Q2.5 bridging implementation and experiment). That works well.\n\nNow let me write detailed questions with keywords. I need to be very thorough with the keywords, including both Chinese and English variants.\n\nLet me write the file now.","signature":"5868b988-c0b7-48a9-86d1-9e430eae9fd1"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":14184,"cache_creation_i